1. the metric: Lorentzian, and vacuum (Ricci-flat) -- symbolic a
  ok    det g < 0 for rho > 0   [det = -64*(eta**2 + xi**2)**2]
  ok    (t,s) block has det -1 => one timelike + one spacelike; transverse block positive -> (1,3)
  ok    Ricci tensor vanishes identically
  ok    Riemann is NOT zero (a genuine wave, not flat space)
  ok    transverse metric = 2|dw|^2 with w = (xi + i eta)^2  (flat; parabolic coordinates)
  ok    profile 4a xi/rho^2 = 4a Re(1/z) is harmonic in (xi, eta)

2. F is a first integral: {H, F} = 0 -- own bracket, symbolic a
  ok    {H, F} = 0 identically
  ok    {p_t, F} = {p_s, F} = 0 (no t or s dependence)
  ok    CONTROL: a perturbed F is NOT conserved (the bracket can fail)

3. dim K1 by integrability conditions (upper bounds per order K)
   pp-wave at a = 3/7, point (xi, eta) = (2/3, 5/4):
      K = 0: stacked rank 4 of 10  ->  dim K1 <= 6
      K = 1: stacked rank 8 of 10  ->  dim K1 <= 2
      K = 2: stacked rank 8 of 10  ->  dim K1 <= 2
